<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"></head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#ecfeff;font-family:'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;">
<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:radial-gradient(circle at top,#ccfbf1 0%,#ecfeff 45%,#f8fafc 100%);padding:40px 12px;">
<tr><td align="center">
<table width="560" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#ffffff;border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(13,148,136,0.15);">

    {# Header #}
    <tr><td style="padding:20px 32px 12px;background:#ffffff;text-align:center;">
        <img src="{{ absolute_url(asset('logo.png')) }}" alt="HrFlow" width="124" style="display:block;margin:0 auto;border:0;outline:none;text-decoration:none;max-width:124px;height:auto;">
    </td></tr>

    <tr><td style="background:linear-gradient(140deg,#0f766e,#14b8a6 45%,#2dd4bf);padding:30px 32px;">
        <p style="margin:0;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.92);font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.8px;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;">Securite compte</p>
        <h1 style="margin:8px 0 0;color:#ffffff;font-size:24px;font-weight:800;line-height:1.2;">Compte modifie</h1>
        <p style="margin:8px 0 0;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.9);font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;">Des modifications ont ete apportees a votre compte HrFlow.</p>
    </td></tr>

    {# Body #}
    <tr><td style="padding:30px 32px 28px;">
        <p style="margin:0 0 16px;color:#18181b;font-size:15px;">Bonjour <strong>{{ username }}</strong>,</p>

        <p style="margin:0 0 20px;color:#3f3f46;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;">
            Les elements suivants de votre compte ont ete mis a jour avec succes :
        </p>

        <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#f8fafc;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;margin-bottom:24px;">
            <tr><td style="padding:16px;">
                <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
                    <tr>
                        <td style="color:#71717a;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;padding:4px 0;">DATE</td>
                        <td style="color:#18181b;font-size:13px;text-align:right;padding:4px 0;">{{ date|date('d/m/Y a H:i') }}</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td style="color:#71717a;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;padding:4px 0;">MODIFICATIONS</td>
                        <td style="color:#18181b;font-size:13px;text-align:right;padding:4px 0;">{{ changes|join(', ')|capitalize }}</td>
                    </tr>
                    {% if newEmail %}
                    <tr>
                        <td style="color:#71717a;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;padding:4px 0;">NOUVEL EMAIL</td>
                        <td style="color:#18181b;font-size:13px;text-align:right;padding:4px 0;">{{ newEmail }}</td>
                    </tr>
                    {% endif %}
                </table>
            </td></tr>
        </table>

        {% if 'mot de passe' in changes %}
        <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#fef9c3;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid #fde68a;margin-bottom:24px;">
            <tr><td style="padding:14px 16px;">
                <p style="margin:0;color:#92400e;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;font-weight:600;">
                    Votre nouveau mot de passe sera actif a la prochaine connexion.
                </p>
            </td></tr>
        </table>
        {% endif %}

        <p style="margin:0;color:#64748b;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;">
            Si vous n'etes pas a l'origine de ces modifications, contactez immediatement votre administrateur et changez votre mot de passe.
        </p>
    </td></tr>

    {# Footer #}
    <tr><td style="padding:18px 32px 24px;border-top:1px solid #eef2f7;text-align:center;background:#fbfffe;">
        <p style="margin:0;color:#94a3b8;font-size:11px;">HrFlow - Gestion des ressources humaines</p>
    </td></tr>

</table>
</td></tr>
</table>
</body>
</html>
